@startuml UC-P3-list-and-open-a-project-design-sequence
!include ../../domain/diagrams/_style.puml
hide footbox
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 100
skinparam ParticipantPadding 6
title UC-P3 List and open a project (design sequence, planned)
' Design level (decision 9), drawn against docs/domain/diagrams/projects-design.puml (decisions 13 and 14).
' The analysis level is UC-P3-list-and-open-a-project-analysis-sequence.puml.
' Step ids are the main flow numbers of UC-P3. PLANNED, NOT BUILT.
' Before step 1 the composition root runs the full check (token, account found, not deactivated, not pending)
' and builds the Caller. That check is the account routes' check and is not drawn.
' Both reads write no audit entry. The detail read adds three empty lists (files, endpoints, evaluations) in the
' route's answer, because those contexts are not built. ProjectNotFound is mapped to 404 in main.py.

actor "Person" as U
participant "Projects-\nService" as S #E7F4EA
participant "Caller" as C #D5E8D4
participant "Project-\nRepository" as R #EEE7F7
participant "Project-\nRules" as PR #FFE6CC
participant "Project" as J #FFE6CC

U -> S : 1 list_for(caller)
S -> C : 3 is_administrator?
alt an administrator
  S -> R : 3 list_all()
else a user
  S -> R : 3 list_for_member(account_id)
end
R --> S : the projects
S --> U : 3 the projects
U -> S : 4 open(caller, project_id)
S -> R : 5 get(project_id)
R --> S : the project, or none
S -> PR : 5 may_see(caller, project)
alt no project, or neither a member\nnor an administrator
  S --> U : 5 ProjectNotFound (404, the same for both)
else
  S -> J : 6 name, memberships
  S --> U : 6 name, members, and empty lists\nfor files, endpoints and evaluations
end
@enduml
